Package: nwauR
Type: Package
Title: Thin R Wrapper for the NWAU Python CLI
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dylan", "Mordaunt", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dylan.mordaunt@vuw.ac.nz")
Author: Dylan Mordaunt [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Dylan Mordaunt <dylan.mordaunt@vuw.ac.nz>
Description: Minimal R wrapper that shells out to the authoritative nwau_py CLI
    and uses CSV interchange so formula logic stays single-sourced in Python.
